00:55:04.050 --> 00:55:06.360
So we were like, let's have
a COVID family Christmas,

00:55:06.360 --> 00:55:09.870
and just go straight across
America on a road trip.

00:55:09.870 --> 00:55:11.560
Brilliant idea.

00:55:11.560 --> 00:55:12.540
To get back to LA,

00:55:12.540 --> 00:55:15.080
