00:56:15.010 --> 00:56:15.843
I don't know.

00:56:15.843 --> 00:56:17.430
It's impossible to make
plans now, but you know what?

00:56:17.430 --> 00:56:19.840
I can get in a car and
drive across America.

00:56:19.840 --> 00:56:22.080
Nobody can tell me I can't do that, right?

